<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Eletropaulo cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Eletropaulo cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robert Fleming analyst Walter Stoeppelwerth has cut his rating for Brazilian power utility Eletropaulo SA to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We are downgrading Eletropaulo from a buy to a hold as we expect cost pressures to dilute some of the benefit from the recent 9.78 percent rate hike effective in early April,&quot; he wrote in a May 15 report.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The stock price cannot break out without a meaningful improvement in cash flow generation.&quot;</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
